{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SkipLists"}],"externalID":"SkipLists","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","symbolKind":"module","title":"SkipLists"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/skiplists"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Skip lists as sorted sets, with their levels as a directed graph."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SkipLists\/documentation\/SkipLists","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"title":"Sorted sets","anchor":"Sorted-sets","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SkipLists\/documentation\/SkipLists\/SkipList"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SkipLists\/documentation\/SkipLists\/SkipList"},{"text":" is a sorted set kept in a skip list (Pugh, 1990): sorted linked lists stacked in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"levels, each level a random sample of the one below, searched from the top level down. Each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"element’s tower gains a level with probability 1\/4, so lookup, insertion and removal take","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"O(log ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") expected time with no rebalancing. Its elements are a random-access collection in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ascending order, indexed by rank, with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lowerBound(_:)"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"upperBound(_:)"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"elements(in:)"},{"text":";","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the API matches the sorted sets of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BinarySearchTrees"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import SkipLists","","var numbers: SkipList = [8, 3, 5, 1, 9]","numbers.insert(4)","numbers.contains(2)     \/\/ false","numbers.lowerBound(5)   \/\/ 3, the index of 5"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tower heights come from a random number generator given at creation; a seeded one makes every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"list reproducible. The list’s levels are a directed acyclic graph, which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SkipLists\/documentation\/SkipLists\/SkipList\/layersView-swift.property","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" exposes to Grafluent’s algorithms and drawings as a "},{"code":"DirectedGraph","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(import Grafluent’s "},{"code":"GraphProtocols","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" module beside this one): a vertex for each element on each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"level of its tower, an edge along each level and an edge down each tower."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://SkipLists/documentation/SkipLists/SkipList":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SkipLists\/documentation\/SkipLists\/SkipList","title":"SkipList","url":"\/documentation\/skiplists\/skiplist","abstract":[{"text":"A sorted set kept in a skip list: sorted linked lists stacked in levels, each level a random","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sample of the one below, searched from the top level down (Pugh, 1990).","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SkipList","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SkipList","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SkipLists/documentation/SkipLists":{"url":"\/documentation\/skiplists","role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"SkipLists","identifier":"doc:\/\/SkipLists\/documentation\/SkipLists","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Skip lists as sorted sets, with their levels as a directed graph."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://SkipLists/documentation/SkipLists/SkipList/layersView-swift.property":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SkipLists\/documentation\/SkipLists\/SkipList\/layersView-swift.property","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The list’s levels as a directed graph: a vertex for each element on each level of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tower, an edge from each to the next element on the same level, and an edge from each down"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the same element on the level below. The head is not a vertex."}],"role":"symbol","conformance":{"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Comparable"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hashable"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"url":"\/documentation\/skiplists\/skiplist\/layersview-swift.property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"layersView","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SkipList","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:9SkipLists0A4ListV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">.","kind":"text"},{"text":"LayersView","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:9SkipLists0A4ListVAASHRzrlE10LayersViewV"}],"type":"topic","title":"layersView"}}}